NVBANANA patch for NVIDIA-NeMo/RL at 87f1dfb1f6e050ec1d8f9dc3a93dbe98ca763280 (Apache-2.0).
Modified by the NVBANANA team: optional pinned-memory data loading and snapshot interval for
the SFT data loader, and an optional CUDA cache release before Megatron gradient finalization.
Both are off unless the ARC2_NEMORL_* environment variables set by training/run_sft.py are present.

